        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb double fronted full red brick 5 bed detached family home</li><li>Wonderfully maintained & superbly well-presented</li><li>Private site with large side driveway access to rear</li><li>2 large reception rooms and separate kitchen and dining room</li><li>Large primary bedroom with ensuite</li><li>Plentiful accommodation, easily configured to suit the needs of any family</li><li>Most prestigious mature residential development</li><li>The Chantries is situated adjacent Balbriggan Golf Club</li><li>Oil Fired central heating & Double Glazed hardwood windows</li><li>Minutes' drive to exit 5, M1 </li><li>Easy access to Dublin Airport and M50 motorway</ul>"
